  "ruleText": "Rev 3201.01 “Aggregate tax credit amount” means the aggregate of tax credits calculated in accordance with RSA 77-G:4.\n\nSource. #10236, eff 11-28-12; ss by #13462, eff 10-13-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 3200)",
